    "Scouting Notes": "POST DRAFT NOTES\n Bentley had a tremendous season at IMG Academy this past year, posting a 0.94 ERA and striking out 62 to only five walks.\n Upper 80s fastball with some carry and a heavy look to it. Sat more low 90's as his season progressed, likely more velo in the tank still\n Changeup is pretty high spin and has late fade, shows advanced feel for it\n Also mixes in an interesting slider that flashes as an above average pitch at times, more of a sweeper\n Also mixes in a bigger curveball in the low 70s with potential to be an average offering\n Command is strong for his age\n This was seen as a very unlikely signing, I think there's a very real starting pitcher mold here to work with",
